Flagellin–TLR5 Analysis Pipeline Overview

This repository contains all scripts used to analyze the role of bacterial flagellin in TLR5 signaling in NSCLC.

Analyses include:

16S rRNA microbiome profiling (QIIME2)

TCGA survival analysis (TLR5)

scRNAseq LUSC+LUAD and controls analysis

Repository Structure

NSCLC_16S/ – QIIME2 processing and downstream microbiome analysis

TCGA-LUAD-TLR5/ – Survival modeling using TLR5 from TCGA LUAD data

metadata/ – Sample metadata for microbiome analysis

Requirements Software QIIME2 (2024.10) R (≥4.4.1) HISAT2 PICRUSt2

Reproducibility

